NAME
     cksharingmanagementd – This is the system daemon backing the CloudKit
     Sharing Participant Management feature.

SYNOPSIS
     takes no arguments, and users should not launch it manually.

DESCRIPTION
     This is the system daemon backing the CloudKit Sharing Participant
     Management feature.

HISTORY
     cksharingmanagementd first appeared in macOS 27.

